        "magnitude": "moderate",
        "rationale": "Past years show high tolls (2,452 in 2024; 1,328 in 2025), making 1,000 deaths within a year plausible."
      },
      {
        "factor": "Seasonal/weather conditions into late winter/early spring",
        "direction": "up",
        "magnitude": "moderate",
