    "synthesis_rationale": "The posterior (0.98) results from updating a plausible anchor with strong recent pace signals and a high historical baseline, while accounting for uncertainty from data gaps and lack of a formal forecast. Correlated factors were treated as additive updates with emphasis on the pace and historical context; the remaining caveats are reporting gaps and potential weather shocks."
  }
}

